From 72ecadcbf9311ae8b7bf196ac39c10ca530098cc Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Kamil Monicz <kamil@monicz.dev>
Date: Sun, 18 Oct 2026 14:02:51 +0000
Subject: [PATCH] Track environment changes used by CMake builds

Cargo could reuse a native build after CMake or compiler environment inputs changed. Emit rerun metadata at cmake-rs environment reads and enable cc-rs environment tracking while querying compilers. The compiler query reports watched inputs without emitting linker metadata. Track PATH at actual bare-tool resolution and VisualStudioVersion at the separate Visual Studio generator probe.

Add a Cargo/CMake fixture for target-qualified precedence and independent environment changes.
